<section class="section section-alt" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq">
            <details>
                <summary>How do I use it in Manager?</summary>
                <p>There is nothing to install. Open the Manager app, go to Extensions, and click the Aussie Bank Feeds extension. Go to Sync, pick your business, then open a bank account to import its transactions.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Do you see my banking password?</summary>
                <p>No. Your bank is connected through <a href="https://basiq.io">Basiq</a>, an Accredited Data Recipient under Australia's Consumer Data Right. You give consent with your bank directly, access is read-only, and you never share your banking credentials with us.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Can I stop sharing my bank data?</summary>
                <p>At any time. Sign in, open Connections and withdraw consent for the bank connection, which stops any further data being collected from it. <a href="/consent/">How we handle your data</a> explains this in full.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>How do I get help?</summary>
                <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

